      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2. 滑雪队里有80名学生，其中有32名女生，求女生",
        "在滑雪队里所占的百分比."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设$p$为女生在滑雪队里所占的百分比. 可用两种方法求",
        "出百分之一：80除以100，或者32除以$p$. 得出比例：",
        "$80:100=32:p$，或$\\frac{80}{100}=\\frac{32}{p}$.",
        "由此得$p=32\\cdot100:80=40$. 就是女生占滑雪队全体成员的",
        "40%."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "911",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "911. 下面的比例是真的吗？",
        "1) $\\frac{2}{3}:\\frac{5}{6}=\\frac{4}{3}:\\frac{5}{3}$；　　2) $1\\frac{1}{3}:\\frac{8}{9}=2\\frac{2}{5}:1\\frac{9}{15}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "912",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "912. 解方程：",
        "1) $y:51.6=11.2:34.4$；　　2) $m:\\frac{25}{6}=\\frac{4}{7}:\\frac{20}{21}$；",
        "3) $67.8:a=7.62:6.35$；　　4) $\\frac{3}{14}:3\\frac{1}{7}=k:3\\frac{2}{3}$."
      ]
    },
